# Both findings live inside pip's vendored packages in the upstream
# python:3.14-slim base (pip 26.2.1 declares its vendored versions and
# the scanner reads them). Nothing this image installs brings them, no
# site package carries them, and the vendored copies cannot be upgraded
# independently of pip. They clear when pip ships an updated vendor set
# and the base rebuilds. Neither is reachable through the served
# application: pip does not run at runtime.
# setuptools PackageIndex path traversal, vendored context only:
CVE-2025-47273
# msgpack Unpacker out-of-bounds read, pip-vendored copy only:
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
